WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.112
After his marriage, Muhammad often went to the Cave of Hira, to sit and think in quiet.

2
00:00:05.512 --> 00:00:12.352
When he was forty, Allah's first revelation came to him: Read, in the name of your Lord who created.

3
00:00:12.752 --> 00:00:15.992
He went home and told his wife Khadijah what had happened.

4
00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:21.624
First he quietly told those closest to him: worship only the One Allah.

5
00:00:22.024 --> 00:00:26.464
Then he preached openly: there is none worthy of worship but Allah.

6
00:00:26.864 --> 00:00:31.184
Faced with mockery and hardship, he remained patient and steadfast.

7
00:00:31.584 --> 00:00:35.616
Allah's revelation kept coming down, guiding more and more people.
